  "family": "global",
  "lineage": "Flirtatious Balinese social dance in which a female joged dancer invites men from the audience to dance with her, accompanied by a bamboo gamelan of grantang tube xylophones (here the t'rung card), suling flutes (here the generic bamboo-flute card), kendang and ceng-ceng. It is especially popular in Buleleng and Jembrana, and UNESCO's inscription of traditional Balinese dance includes it among the entertainment dances.",
